AEMeasurable with respect to μ, then ∫⁻ a, ∑' i, f(i,a) ∂μ = ∑' i, ∫⁻ a, f(i,a) ∂μ.\"},{\"op\":\"replace\",\"path\":\"/graph/propositions/3/source/statement\",\"value\":\"For every measurable space (α,m), measure μ on α, countable type β, and function f:β→α→ENNReal, if for every i:β the function f(i) is AEMeasurable with respect to μ, then ∫⁻ a, ∑' i, f(i,a) ∂μ = ∑' i, ∫⁻ a, f(i,a) ∂μ.\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/propositions/-\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"M003\",\"kind\":\"mathlib\",\"statement\":\"For every extended metric space X equipped with a measurable space and its Borel structure, every set A⊆X, and d:NNReal, if dimH(A)<↑d, then Measure.hausdorffMeasure (↑d) A=0.\",\"definitions\":[],\"binders\":[],\"objects\":[\"dim_H\",\"Hausdorff measure\"],\"source\":{\"statement\":\"For every extended metric space X equipped with a measurable space and its Borel structure, every set A⊆X, and d:NNReal, if dimH(A)<↑d, then Measure.hausdorffMeasure (↑d) A=0.\",\"hypotheses\":[\"X has an extended metric, a measurable space, and its Borel structure.\"],\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"library/M003-0003/library-sources.json\",\"sha256\":\"1125abdd045414b77de535b6a894fe6f0b00405f9a789322387abc73ce3b44ae\"}],\"declaration\":\"hausdorffMeasure_of_dimH_lt\",\"module\":\"Mathlib.Topology.MetricSpace.HausdorffDimension\"}}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/propositions/-\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"M004\",\"kind\":\"mathlib\",\"statement\":\"For extended metric spaces X,Y, K:NNReal, and f:X→Y, if f is LipschitzWith K, then for every set A⊆X, dimH(f '' A)≤dimH(A).\",\"definitions\":[],\"binders\":[],\"objects\":[\"dim_H\",\"Lipschitz map\"],\"source\":{\"statement\":\"For extended metric spaces X,Y, K:NNReal, and f:X→Y, if f is LipschitzWith K, then for every set A⊆X, dimH(f '' A)≤dimH(A).\",\"hypotheses\":[\"X and Y have extended metric structures.\",\"K is NNReal and f is K-Lipschitz.\"],\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"library/M004-0004/library-sources.json\",\"sha256\":\"dd30ba1d4513237567f5df27221dc686c3b7ce34f3904b593c6d8f3f5152cbc4\"}],\"declaration\":\"LipschitzWith.dimH_image_le\",\"module\":\"Mathlib.Topology.MetricSpace.HausdorffDimension\"}}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/propositions/-\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"M005\",\"kind\":\"mathlib\",\"statement\":\"For a finite-dimensional real normed vector space V and set A⊆V, if interior(A) is nonempty, then dimH(A)=↑(finrank ℝ V).\",\"definitions\":[],\"binders\":[],\"objects\":[\"dim_H\",\"interior\",\"finrank\"],\"source\":{\"statement\":\"For a finite-dimensional real normed vector space V and set A⊆V, if interior(A) is nonempty, then dimH(A)=↑(finrank ℝ V).\",\"hypotheses\":[\"V is a real normed additive commutative group and real normed space.\",\"V is finite-dimensional over ℝ.\",\"The interior of A is nonempty.\"],\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"library/M005-0005/library-sources.json\",\"sha256\":\"da2415f5b7b6ce489c280c1151bcde21a066080ee38cd6ba0184807c807b8757\"}],\"declaration\":\"Real.dimH_of_nonempty_interior\",\"module\":\"Mathlib.Topology.MetricSpace.HausdorffDimension\"}}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/propositions/-\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"M006\",\"kind\":\"mathlib\",\"statement\":\"For every natural number n, dimH(univ of ℝ^n)=↑n.\",\"definitions\":[],\"binders\":[],\"objects\":[\"dim_H\",\"ℝ^n\"],\"source\":{\"statement\":\"For every natural number n, dimH(univ of ℝ^n)=↑n.\",\"hypotheses\":[\"n is a natural number; the ambient space is the standard finite-dimensional real coordinate space with its Euclidean metric.\"],\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"library/M006-0006/library-sources.json\",\"sha256\":\"a8df9855de72f9c148a4e174cd756195bfac5b76ea4eb2bbccbb504fa2768d5f\"}],\"declaration\":\"Real.dimH_univ_pi_fin\",\"module\":\"Mathlib.Topology.MetricSpace.HausdorffDimension\"}}}]}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report exact status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP or SUSPECTED_GAP stops for an actual unsupported mathematical implication; give its premises, conclusion and mathematical grounds. SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT stops for a real source-access/original-input obstacle. Ordinary unfinished drafting, source registration or format work must use TASK_INCOMPLETE: this records progress without ending the stage; continue the actual work. Difficulty or artifact incompletion alone is not a mathematical gap.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of check_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of submit_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"probe_library","description":"Query a proved Mathlib theorem and its exact signature/axioms in the offline sandbox. Returns located evidence for an M source; the mathematical statement and applicability still require review.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"declaration":{"type":"string"},"module":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","declaration","module"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_draft","description":"Read a JSON pointer in your own same-st